    value: Genie
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>50 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1_1
    value: <style=title><size=30><b>MEGA SCATTER</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1_2
    value: <style=title><size=30><b>SCATTER</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1_3
    value: <style=title><size=26><b>WILD</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_1
    value: '<size=18>3 or more Mega Scatters triggers

      Mega Free Games.</size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_2
    value: '<size=18>3 or more Scatters triggers

      Free Games.</size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_3
    value: "<size=15>- In Base Games, entire Wild symbols trigger the Expanding\n 
      Genie Feature.\n- In Free Games, even partial Wilds trigger the Expanding\n 
      Genie Feature.\n- Wild substitutes for all symbols except Mega Scatter and\n 
      Scatter.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT_1
    value: '<b><size=28>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3
      <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT_2
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3
      <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=35>EXPANDING GENIE FEATURE</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: "<size=20>- The game has a 10x5 reel set. Bottom 5 rows are active by\n 
      default. Top 5 rows stay locked unless activated by the\n  Expanding Genie
      Feature.\n\n- Wild symbol is 3x1 in size. If the Wild symbol appears fully,\n 
      Expanding Genie Feature is triggered, and top 5 rows\n  become active. The
      game transforms to 100 Lines.\n\n- Any full 3x1 Wilds that appeared anywhere
      in the 10x5 reel\n  set expands and fill the entire reel.\n\n- Expanding Genie
      Feature is valid for one spin only.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_1
    value: <style=title><size=35>FREE GAMES</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_2
    value: <style=title><size=35>UPGRADE FREE GAMES</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_1
    value: "<size=22>\n- Scatter is 2x1 in size, and even partial Scatter in the\n 
      active reels triggers Free Games.\r\n\n- In Base Games, 3 or more Scatters
      triggers Free Games.\n  Number of free spins depends on the number of Scatters\n 
      when Free Games is triggered. \r\n\n- In Free Games, even partially appearing
      Wilds trigger the\n  Expanding Genie Feature.\r\n\n- With Expanding Genie Feature,
      all locked rows become\n   unlocked. \r\n\n- Any Wilds that appeared anywhere
      in the 10x5 reel set\n  expands to fill the entire reel.  \r\n\n- 3 or more
      Scatters in Free Games re-triggers Free Games,\n  awarding additional spins.\r\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_2
    value: "<size=22>- 3 or more Mega Scatters during Free Games turns\n  all remaining
      Free Games to Mega Free Games and\n  awards additional spins.\n\n- Number of
      additional spins depends on the number of\n  Mega Scatters when Mega Free Games
      is triggered.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: <style=title><size=35>MEGA FREE GAMES</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "<size=24>- Mega Scatter is 2x1 in size, and even partial\n  Mega Scatter
      in the active reels triggers the\n  Mega Free Games.\n\n- During Base and Free
      Games, 3 or more\n  Mega Scatters triggers Mega Free Games.\n  Number of free
      spins depends on the number of\n  Mega Scatters when the bonus is triggered.\n\n-
      In Mega Free Games, the entire 10x5 area\n  is active.\n\n- In Mega Free Games,
      even partial 3x1 Wild\n  triggers the Expanding Genie Feature. \n\n- In Mega
      Free Games, only Mega Scatters appear. \n\n- 3 or more Mega Scatters in Mega
      Free Games\n  re-triggers Mega Free Games.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_EXTRA
    value: <style=title><size=35>EXTRA BET</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_EXTRA
    value: "<size=24>- 100% of Line Bet is added as Extra Bet to enable\n   more
      Wild Symbols in all games and to activate\n   Mega Free Games.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_5
    value: <style=title><size=35>LINES</style>
